  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY插珠帐篷城堡拼搭积木套装",
    "en": "DIY Bead Fort Castle Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童DIY拼搭场景的插珠帐篷城堡积木套装，适用于家庭互动、课堂活动与主题展示空间，可进行多次拆装重构。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地中国东莞茶山，支持加工定制，适合常规渠道供货与活动配套。",
    "en": "This is a DIY bead-fort castle set for children’s construction scenarios. It fits family interaction, classroom activities, and themed display spaces with repeatable assembly and reconfiguration.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan, China. Custom processing is supported for regular channel supply and activity projects."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY插珠帐篷城堡拼搭积木套装采用杆件与连接球组合结构，可搭建帐篷、城堡与游戏空间，适用于儿童创意拼搭与互动活动。",
      "产品支持加工定制与重复拆装，能够按渠道需求进行组合配置。品牌为尧顺，定位儿童拼搭玩具及教学互动场景使用。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，包装重量2300g，积木净重0.05KG，规格YG100PCS，适合电商和渠道批量采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY bead fort castle set uses a rod-and-connector system to build tents, castles, and play spaces for children’s creative construction and interactive activities.",
      "The product supports custom processing and repeated assembly, allowing flexible configuration for channel needs. Brand: Yaoshun, positioned for kids construction play and educational interaction scenarios.",
      "Packed in a color box with a 2300g package weight, 0.05kg net block weight, and YG100PCS specification, it is suitable for e-commerce and channel bulk procurement."
    ]
  },
